      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I didn't provide this in my post because mine was more focused on explaining a certain issue rather than trying to hit a bunch at once. But here's some screenshots that are relevant to your post. Sorry for not catching everything you did. \n\nEdit: First is of content not fitting. Second is of weird artifacts on the corners. Third is weird padding choices.",
