  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-01T19:18:05.719Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hey, the new UI is great, but there is a few problems with it currently:\n- The content is bigger than the background\n- The text in the buttons are overlapping the background of the buttons\n- There is pixel artefacts on the bottom left of the pickers\n- The settings UI is too transparent\n- The \"Go\" and \"Drop Portal\" button of the world menu aren't aligned to the image\n- The \"Back\" button isn't vertically centered\n- There should be a little padding between the content and the background border of the pages\n\nI can send you some pictures of how I would correct it if wanted\n\n\n__EDIT 1 (07/11 @ 4pm GMT+1):__\nYou can see some of the problems on bote's comment, and on his canny post (https://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/build-647-201841-inconsistent-ui-button-appearance)\nAlso, there is another UI problem with the 2-buttons popup UI",
